{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And he was the son of an Egyptian man.</b> It was he who caused him to curse HaShem, for it is the way of Egyptians to degrade HaShem, as Pharaoh said: ״לא ידעתי את ה׳״." "<b>And they fought in the camp.</b> His fellow said to him: Your father the Egyptian — Moses killed him. He said to him: With what? He said to him: With the Explicit Name, as we expounded. Immediately: ״ויקב את השם ויקלל״."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:25.097294616Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}